          <ul style="color: #5c727f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <li><strong>Mnarani Marine Turtle Pond (Nungwi):</strong> Rescued turtles rehabilitated, released when ready. Educational, conservation-focused.</li>
            <li><strong>Chumbe Island:</strong> Protected nesting beaches, hatchling releases monitored by marine biologists.</li>
            <li><strong>Salaam Cave Turtle Sanctuary (Kizimkazi):</strong> Community-run, turtles in natural lagoon, strict no-touch policy.</li>
            <li><strong>Night nesting watches (Chumbe, Mnemba):</strong> Guided by marine biologists, zero disturbance.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="color: #0C1A24; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">🚫 Avoid These Turtle "Experiences"</h3>
          <ul style="color: #78350f; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <li>Holding/riding turtles for photos</li>
            <li>Feeding turtles by hand (disrupts natural diet)</li>
            <li>Keeping turtles in small tanks for tourist viewing</li>
            <li>"Turtle release" events where tourists handle hatchlings</li>
            <li>Any operator guaranteeing turtle swims</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

